# App routing

Keep `page.tsx` and route handlers thin.

- Do not call Supabase from `page.tsx` or a route handler.
- Reads go through `src/features/<feature>/server/queries.ts`.
- Writes from a route go through `src/features/<feature>/server/actions.ts` or `db/*.ts` after the handler has only parsed the HTTP request.

```ts
const quote = await getQuoteForPage(id);
if (!quote) return Response.json({ error: "Quote not found" }, { status: 404 });
```
